NIST ZENO in US-SOMO
====================

This directory holds part of NIST ZENO 5.3.1, from https://github.com/usnistgov/ZENO
at commit b3bb3e9 ("Bumped version from 5.3.0 to 5.3.1", 2023-01-20).  The copied
files are unchanged in that repository through commit 459ae06 (2026-04-28).

  libzeno/          the ZENO library (cpp/libzeno)
  zeno-cli/src/     from NIST's command-line program (cpp/zeno-cli/src): the option
                    parser generated by gengetopt (cmdline.c, cmdline.h, from
                    options.ggo) and ParametersLocal
  README.NIST.md    NIST's README, with the reference to cite

It replaces the NIST ZENO 5.0.1 that was amalgamated into src/us_zeno_cxx.cpp,
include/us_zeno_cxx.h and include/us_zeno_cxx_nf.h.

